    "The address is right — something answered. claude-bridge wants the password it was started with as BRIDGE_PASSWORD; opencode wants none unless you set one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Adresse stimmt – etwas hat geantwortet. claude-bridge erwartet das Passwort, mit dem es gestartet wurde, als BRIDGE_PASSWORD; opencode erwartet keines, außer du hast eines festgelegt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address is right — something answered. claude-bridge wants the password it was started with as BRIDGE_PASSWORD; opencode wants none unless you set one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dirección es correcta: algo respondió. claude-bridge quiere la contraseña con la que se inició, como BRIDGE_PASSWORD; opencode no quiere ninguna a menos que hayas configurado una."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’adresse est correcte — quelque chose a répondu. claude-bridge attend le mot de passe avec lequel il a été démarré, sous la forme BRIDGE_PASSWORD ; opencode n’en attend aucun, sauf si vous en avez défini un."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’indirizzo è corretto — qualcosa ha risposto. claude-bridge vuole la password con cui è stato avviato, come BRIDGE_PASSWORD; opencode non ne vuole nessuna a meno che tu non ne abbia impostata una."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アドレスは正しく、何かが応答しました。claude-bridge は起動時に指定したパスワードを BRIDGE_PASSWORD として求めます。opencode は、設定していない限りパスワードを必要としません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "주소는 맞습니다 — 무언가 응답했습니다. claude-bridge는 시작할 때 지정한 암호를 BRIDGE_PASSWORD로 요구합니다. opencode는 따로 설정하지 않았다면 암호가 필요 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O endereço está certo — algo respondeu. O claude-bridge quer a senha com que foi iniciado, como BRIDGE_PASSWORD; o opencode não quer nenhuma, a menos que você tenha definido uma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地址是对的——有东西响应了。claude-bridge 需要它启动时使用的密码，作为 BRIDGE_PASSWORD；opencode 除非你自己设置过，否则不需要密码。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "位址是對的——有東西回應了。claude-bridge 需要它啟動時使用的密碼，作為 BRIDGE_PASSWORD；opencode 除非你自己設定過，否則不需要密碼。"
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adres jest prawidłowy — coś odpowiedziało. claude-bridge oczekuje hasła, z którym został uruchomiony, jako BRIDGE_PASSWORD; opencode nie oczekuje żadnego, chyba że jakieś ustawisz."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adressen er rigtig – noget har svaret. claude-bridge kræver den adgangskode, den blev startet med, som BRIDGE_PASSWORD. opencode kræver ingen, medmindre du har angivet en."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osoite on oikein, sillä jokin vastasi. claude-bridge vaatii sen salasanan, jolla se käynnistettiin (ympäristömuuttuja BRIDGE_PASSWORD). opencode ei vaadi mitään, ellet ole asettanut salasanaa."
          }
        },
        "is": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vistfangið er rétt, eitthvað svaraði. claude-bridge vill lykilorðið sem það var ræst með sem BRIDGE_PASSWORD; opencode vill ekkert, nema þú hafir sett eitt."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adressen er riktig, siden noe svarte. claude-bridge vil ha passordet den ble startet med, som BRIDGE_PASSWORD. opencode vil ikke ha noe, med mindre du har satt et."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adressen är rätt, något svarade. claude-bridge vill ha lösenordet den startades med som BRIDGE_PASSWORD. opencode vill inte ha något, om du inte har angett ett."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It gave no reason.": {
